# Local values for `astro dev` and `wrangler dev`. Copy to `.dev.vars` (git-ignored).
#
# The home page is a placeholder and nothing renders CMS content yet, but 'view as user'
# (PJ-119, docs/VIEW-AS-USER.md) already needs both of these. PJ-35's CMS client will use them too:
#   CMS_URL=https://mc-cms.labcat.workers.dev
#   SITE_KEY=sk_…                  the vwok tenant's site key (a secret, never public)
# and the form islands (PJ-45, PJ-47) will need the public Turnstile site key, whose documented
# test value always passes:
#   PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=1x00000000000000000000AA
